{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:53:34+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:53:34+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Shurgard Self Storage Ltd","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Specialty","country":"Guernsey","city":"St Peter Port","website":"https://www.shurgard.com","employees":821,"summary":"Shurgard Self Storage Ltd, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the acquisition, development, and operation of self-storage facilities for business and personal use. The company also offers various ancillary services at its self-storage facilities consisting of sale of storage products and provision of protection through an independent insurance company for customers' stored goods. The company owns and/or operates 267 self-storage facilities and approximately 1.4 million net rentable square meters in France, the Netherlands, the United Kingdom, Sweden, Germany, Belgium, and Denmark. Shurgard Self Storage Ltd was founded in 1995 and is based in St Peter Port, Guernsey.","exchange":"Brussels","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Shurgard Self Storage Ltd, en collaboration avec ses filiales, s'engage dans l'acquisition, le développement et l'exploitation d'installations de self-stockage pour un usage professionnel et personnel. La société offre également divers services auxiliaires dans ses installations de self-stockage consistant en la vente de produits de stockage et en la fourniture d'une protection par l'intermédiaire d'une compagnie d'assurance indépendante pour les biens stockés des clients. La société possède et / ou exploite 267 installations de self-stockage et environ 1,4 million de mètres carrés nets louables en France, aux Pays-Bas, au Royaume-Uni, en Suède, en Allemagne, en Belgique et au Danemark."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":2418287104,"shares_outstanding":100972323,"trailing_pe":7.7759743,"forward_pe":13.995455,"